  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 102.02 \"Physical therapist\" means \"physical therapist\" as defined in RSA 328-A:2, VII, namely, \"a person who is licensed pursuant to this chapter to practice physical therapy in this state. \"\n\nSource. #9039, eff 11-28-07; ss by #12993, eff 2-22-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Phy 100); ss by #14385, eff 9-23-25",
